;; monosashi 物差し — predictive-actor skill yardstick manifest (Gen-3 kotoba-native).
;; A MEASURE, never a TARGET: it scores how well the predictive actors (hakoniwa /
;; mitooshi / tsuchifumi) forecast, and is STRUCTURALLY firewalled from reward (mio).
;; "When a measure becomes a target it ceases to be a good measure" (Goodhart) — so the
;; skill score never routes to :reward. ADR-2606271800.
{:actor/id "monosashi"
 :actor/glyph "物差し"
 :actor/display-name "物差し — Predictive-Actor Skill Yardstick"
 :actor/tier :tier-b
 :actor/did "did:web:etzhayyim.com:actor:monosashi"
 :actor/adr ["2606271800"]
 :actor/related ["2606051800" "2606111500" "2606212000" "2606212200"]
 :actor/primary-lexicon "com.etzhayyim.monosashi.skillBand"
 :actor/purpose
 "Cross-actor forecast-skill YARDSTICK (proper-scoring meta-evaluator). Reads mitooshi's leak-free score residuals (CRPS / pinball / logscore / skill-vs-baseline / PIT) and cross-checks them against tsuchifumi's system-dynamics ensemble for band-width coherence, emitting a DISTRIBUTION-ONLY reliability band (p10/p50/p90) of each predictive actor's skill. It is a MEASURE, never a TARGET (anti-Goodhart): the skill score is structurally firewalled from reward (mio) — no :eval/reward attribute exists and none may ever be added (mirrors mio's :consumed-reward ban). Routed to planners / Council for attention, member-signed (G7); never a trade signal (G2)."
 :actor/integrates ["mitooshi" "tsuchifumi" "hakoniwa" "mio"]
 :actor/cells
 [{:cell/id "score"   :cell/kind :datalog :cell/runtime :kotoba}
  {:cell/id "social"  :cell/kind :langgraph :cell/runtime :wasm}
  {:cell/id "persist" :cell/kind :datalog :cell/runtime :kotoba}]
 :actor/methods
 [{:method/id "skill-band"   :method/file "methods/score.cljc"
   :method/role "Aggregate per-actor mitooshi score residuals into a p10/p50/p90 skill-vs-baseline band + calibration; cross-check band-width coherence vs tsuchifumi sysdyn. Distribution-only (G1/G6); anti-Goodhart reward-firewall (G3); skilled only if p50 skill>0 vs documented baseline (G12)."}
  {:method/id "social-emit"  :method/file "methods/social.cljc"
   :method/role "Draft + emit a skill-band social post (G2 no-point / G3 no-steer scans re-applied; G7 member-signed). Persisted to the canonical kotoba Datom log."}
  {:method/id "kotoba-persist" :method/file "methods/kotoba.cljc"
   :method/role "Append-only content-addressed Datom log (commit-DAG, tamper-evident, resume-safe) for skill-band records + audit trail."}
  {:method/id "autorun"      :method/file "methods/autorun.cljc"
   :method/role "Deterministic idempotent-by-content heartbeat: read new mitooshi residuals + tsuchifumi context → skill-band → draft+emit → persist one tx per cycle (caller supplies tx-id + as-of; no wall clock)."}]
 :actor/lex [{:lex/id "skillBand"}]
 :actor/gates
 {"G1" "distribution-only — the skill output is a p10/p50/p90 band, never a single grade; :eval/point-asserted is const false and no :eval/point field may exist (非終末論)"
  "G2" "non-speculative — :eval/use ∈ {model-assessment, resilience, planning, research}; trade / position / target are NOT enum members; a skill score is never a trade signal"
  "G3" "anti-Goodhart / reward-decoupled — the skill score NEVER routes to :reward; no :eval/reward or :eval/target attribute exists and none may be added (mirrors mio :consumed-reward ban). The social post is non-steering (guard-no-steer)"
  "G5" "leak-free — every aggregated residual's :score/observed-at is REQUIRED (no silent skip) and MUST be ≤ :eval/as-of, compared as parsed instants (offset-correct, not raw strings); you cannot grade with outcomes from the future relative to publication. (The upstream mitooshi G5 — observed-at > forecast info-as-of — is enforced where the residual is produced, not re-checked here.)"
  "G6" "ensemble-only — the reliability band is computed over the per-forecast skill ENSEMBLE; a point grade is structurally unrepresentable (inherits tsuchifumi G6)"
  "G7" "member-signed — a :published skill post requires a member-DID author; :post/server-held-key is false (no server key, operator-gated external relay)"
  "G12" "anti-pseudoscience — :eval/skilled is true ONLY if the p50 skill > 0 vs a documented baseline (climatology / persistence / random-walk, supplied by mitooshi); no hidden overconfidence"}}
